1
00:00:00,034 --> 00:00:02,534
(Howard:)Our eyes locked over the pickled herring.

2
00:00:02,703 --> 00:00:05,293
(Howard:)We never meant for it to happen.

3
00:00:06,123 --> 00:00:09,123
(Raj:)One day, I hold a great ball
for the president of France.

4
00:00:09,293 --> 00:00:11,463
(Raj:)But the rabbits,
they hate me and don't come.

5
00:00:11,629 --> 00:00:16,259
I'm embarrassed, so I eat all the lettuce
in the world and make them watch.

6
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,550
(Leonard:)People could call me Angie.

7
00:00:21,806 --> 00:00:24,436
[IN NEW YORK ACCENT]
"Yo, Angie. How's it going?"

8
00:00:25,893 --> 00:00:28,183
(Howard:)To this day,
I can't look at pickled herring...

9
00:00:28,354 --> 00:00:31,524
(Howard:)...without being aroused and ashamed.

10
00:00:32,483 --> 00:00:35,523
(Howard:)Oh, cousin Jeanie.

11
00:00:38,864 --> 00:00:39,904
[PENNY SIGHS]

12
00:00:40,074 --> 00:00:42,364
(Penny:)Could you please drive a little faster?

13
00:00:42,535 --> 00:00:45,245
(Sheldon:)Oh, I think we're going sufficiently fast.

14
00:00:46,288 --> 00:00:47,578
[ENGINE KNOCKING]

15
00:00:47,748 --> 00:00:48,788
(Sheldon:)-What's that?
-Nothing.

16
00:00:48,958 --> 00:00:51,548
(Penny:)-The engine does that sometimes.
-It can't be nothing.

17
00:00:51,711 --> 00:00:54,501
The "check engine" light is on.
We need a service station.

18
00:00:54,672 --> 00:00:56,842
The light's been on
since I bought the car.

19
00:00:57,007 --> 00:01:01,027
(Sheldon:)All the more reason to consult
with a mechanic before it explodes.

